WEBVTT

00:18:29.538 --> 00:18:34.038
click on the link. Your responses and
your data will be anonymized.

00:18:34.413 --> 00:18:37.454
Unfortunately, because I'm
such a privacy freak,

00:18:37.454 --> 00:18:40.371
I cannot send you a copy of your answers.

00:18:40.704 --> 00:18:43.371
But, you know, if you feel like
they could be useful later,

00:18:43.371 --> 00:18:47.871
go ahead and take some screenshots of your
responses. Oh, and one more thing.

00:18:47.871 --> 00:18:49.204
After you take the survey,

00:18:49.496 --> 00:18:54.746
just observe what questions your
brain starts mulling over.

00:18:55.204 --> 00:18:56.871
Let those ideas marinate.